-- statement:
--   Under exactly the original spectrally negative Levy law, dividend strategy, standing axioms, σ=0, infinite-variation negative jumps, C2 HJB and capped stopping data, construct for each original clock an integrable same-space compensated source martingale with conditional expectation zero at 𝓕.rightCont 0 and an a.e. physical stopped discounted terminal-plus-Iic-cash upper bound. Required derivation uses predictable marked negative-jump compensation, finite-band L2/localisation and L1 infinite activity passage; no independent or auxiliary process or postulated Ito decomposition is permitted.
